MENU
- the entries in menudata.xml and module_tree_menudata.xml are autogenerated
  by core/toolboxes.py from main_menu.xml (or module_tree.xml), toolboxes.xml,
  wxgui_items.xml and module_items.xml, which is generated by
  tools/build_modules_xml.py (see ../Makefile and ../CMakeLists.txt)
- How the menus are built and translated is described in
  ../../../doc/development/wxgui_menus.md
- Find more info at
  https://grass.osgeo.org/grass-devel/manuals/wxGUI.toolboxes.html
  (../docs/wxgui_sphinx/src/)
- additionally
  https://trac.osgeo.org/grass/wiki/wxGUIDevelopment/Toolboxes
